# Cloudflare Pages — redirect rules
# Format: <pattern> <destination> <status>
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# Apex / www unification: both kriseva.in AND www.kriseva.in serve the same site
# from Cloudflare Pages. We do NOT redirect between them at this layer; let
# Cloudflare's custom-domain provisioning handle which one is canonical.
# (If you later want to force one canonical domain, uncomment ONE of the rules
# below and redeploy.)

# Force apex → www:
# https://kriseva.in/* https://www.kriseva.in/:splat 301

# Force www → apex (recommended for procurement-grade URLs):
# https://www.kriseva.in/* https://kriseva.in/:splat 301

# ─── Future redirects (none now) ──────────────────────────────────────
# If pages get renamed in the future, add 301s here so old links keep working.
# Example:
# /old-tas-page /tas 301
